flowchart LR
    Browser[Admin Browser]
    Edge[Regional ALB / WAF]
    BFF[Regional Control Backend / BFF]
    Session[Authenticated Session]
    Tenant[TenantContext Resolver]
    Feature[Server Feature Evaluator]
    Authz[Authorization / Ownership]
    Logic[Business Logic]
    DBTX[PostgreSQL Transaction]
    RLS[RLS Context]
    Data[(Tenant Data)]
    Audit[(Admin Audit)]
    Outbox[(Outbox)]

    Browser --> Edge --> BFF --> Session --> Tenant
    Tenant --> Feature --> Authz --> Logic --> DBTX
    DBTX --> RLS --> Data
    DBTX --> Audit
    DBTX --> Outbox

    Global[System Kill / Security Floor] --> Feature
    Deploy[Deployment Override] --> Feature
    TenantOverride[Tenant Override] --> Feature
    Default[Feature Default] --> Feature

    Note1[Client tenant IDs are navigation inputs only]
    Note2[Precedence: System security > deployment > tenant > default]
    Tenant -.-> Note1
    Feature -.-> Note2
